WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.712
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emma. Welcome to Online B one, Book one.

2
00:00:05.012 --> 00:00:08.526
Hi! I'm Visal. Let's learn together!

3
00:00:08.826 --> 00:00:14.926
Unit two: School Subjects. Today you will compare school subjects and say which you prefer.

4
00:00:15.226 --> 00:00:17.890
Here is our lesson map. Let's start!

5
00:00:18.833 --> 00:00:22.240
Part one: words. You will learn twelve new words.

6
00:00:23.083 --> 00:00:24.073
Timetable.

7
00:00:25.083 --> 00:00:27.768
