9
00:00:30.850 --> 00:00:33.317
Your turn. Say: Timetable.

10
00:00:36.167 --> 00:00:37.145
Timetable.

11
00:00:37.883 --> 00:00:39.221
Mathematics.

12
00:00:40.217 --> 00:00:43.226
